      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "22 Cherryfield Drive, Walkinstown, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are proud to present 22 Cherryfield Drive to the market. This opportunity to acquire a beautiful 3 bedroom family home in the highly sought after area of Cherryfield is not one to be missed.\r\n\r\nNumber 22 benefits from fantastic local amenities to include many shops, cafes, Cherryfield park, primary and secondary schools as well as being in close proximity to the Ashleaf Shopping Centre and Crumlin Village. \r\n\r\nUpon entering the property you are immediately met with a bright and open entrance hallway. Just off this you have a cosy front reception room fitted with a classic feature fireplace. Passed this you have a second reception room which could also double as a dining room creating a fantastic open living/dining area. Downstairs also comprises a fully equipped kitchen.\r\n\r\nOne of the most noteworthy features of this property is the large back garden. South facing and private, it's ideal for relaxing or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nMoving upstairs you have a large double bedroom alongside a fully tiled family bathroom to the rear and a double alongside a single bedroom to the front aspect.\r\n\r\nThis area of Walkinstown has fantastic public transport links with many bus routes such as the S4 and F3 within walking distance. The M50 and N7 motorways are also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties. \r\n\r\nThis property will be very popular so early viewing is recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Sought after location\r\n- South Facing back garden\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Plenty of living space"
      },
